    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOMAD calls you into a vast, open world shaped by the Silk Road era\u2019s cultural crossroads, nomadic traditions, and mythical folklore. As a wandering survivor, forge your own destiny; hunt, trade, form alliances or rivalries, and face both natural and supernatural threats.Pack your camp, migrate across ever-changing lands, and build a legendary nomadic legacy in a world\u00a0where survival must be earned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/fa123fb5fddd9ff0f88b7c2a71f9de1b.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/fa123fb5fddd9ff0f88b7c2a71f9de1b.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival &amp; Mobility</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clan is never bound to one place. Pack tents, herd animals, and migrate to resource-rich lands or safer climates as seasons shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b807d85058a1c6963e5b386fba061959.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b807d85058a1c6963e5b386fba061959.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Myth &amp; Lore</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face creatures from ancient Asian mythologies, explore enchanted forests glowing with mystical flora, resonating with shamanic rituals, survive cursed groves haunted by spirits, and unlock hidden wisdom through sacred stone totems.\u00a0Every encounter with a creature is a turning point; some demand combat, others offer cryptic paths through dialogue. You choose your stance: Hunt them. Hear them. Or become something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b581a36e064dbf0dd11acdf4372dd353.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b581a36e064dbf0dd11acdf4372dd353.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultural &amp; Economic Interactions</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with diverse factions across Asia\u2019s vast trade networks. Trade refined goods in bustling border towns, barter with traveling caravans, or negotiate with roaming warbands; shape the region\u2019s trade routes through diplomacy or force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/82226911fe8036d4ff3a0a956d07f4fe.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/82226911fe8036d4ff3a0a956d07f4fe.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal &amp; Environmental Challenges</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fully dynamic world with shifting seasons and weather extremes. Adapt to summer droughts, harsh winters, and changing wildlife behaviors that impact survival and trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOMAD calls you into a vast, open world shaped by the Silk Road era\u2019s cultural crossroads, nomadic traditions, and mythical folklore. As a wandering survivor, forge your own destiny; hunt, trade, form alliances or rivalries, and face both natural and supernatural threats.Pack your camp, migrate across ever-changing lands, and build a legendary nomadic legacy in a world\u00a0where survival must be earned.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/fa123fb5fddd9ff0f88b7c2a71f9de1b.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/fa123fb5fddd9ff0f88b7c2a71f9de1b.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival &amp; Mobility</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clan is never bound to one place. Pack tents, herd animals, and migrate to resource-rich lands or safer climates as seasons shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b807d85058a1c6963e5b386fba061959.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b807d85058a1c6963e5b386fba061959.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Myth &amp; Lore</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face creatures from ancient Asian mythologies, explore enchanted forests glowing with mystical flora, resonating with shamanic rituals, survive cursed groves haunted by spirits, and unlock hidden wisdom through sacred stone totems.\u00a0Every encounter with a creature is a turning point; some demand combat, others offer cryptic paths through dialogue. You choose your stance: Hunt them. Hear them. Or become something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b581a36e064dbf0dd11acdf4372dd353.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/b581a36e064dbf0dd11acdf4372dd353.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cultural &amp; Economic Interactions</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with diverse factions across Asia\u2019s vast trade networks. Trade refined goods in bustling border towns, barter with traveling caravans, or negotiate with roaming warbands; shape the region\u2019s trade routes through diplomacy or force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/82226911fe8036d4ff3a0a956d07f4fe.poster.avif?t=1750691289\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564480/extras/82226911fe8036d4ff3a0a956d07f4fe.webm?t=1750691289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasonal &amp; Environmental Challenges</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fully dynamic world with shifting seasons and weather extremes. Adapt to summer droughts, harsh winters, and changing wildlife behaviors that impact survival and trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
